  "bio": "Isabela Matina is a masterful tattoo artist based in Contagem, Brazil, specializing in the illustrative style that brings artwork to life on the skin. Recognized for maintaining impeccable cleanliness in her workspace, Isabela ensures a safe and hygienic environment for all her clients, reflecting her commitment to professionalism in every aspect of her work. Her studio has become a respected destination for those seeking top-quality, artistically inspired tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Contagem, Minas Gerais, Brazil"
